1
00:00:00,049 --> 00:00:01,429
(Amy(tablet ringing):)How's it going, Sheldon?

2
00:00:01,550 --> 00:00:03,430
(Sheldon:)Actually, much better.

3
00:00:03,686 --> 00:00:05,066
(Stuart:)Oh, good.
Is the baby born yet?

4
00:00:05,187 --> 00:00:07,187
(Sheldon:)I don't know
I just got back.

5
00:00:07,356 --> 00:00:08,296
(Amy:)Where'd you go?

6
00:00:08,424 --> 00:00:11,304
(Sheldon:)My mother asked me
to get some towels.

7
00:00:11,427 --> 00:00:13,377
(Sheldon:)I took advantage
of the vague request

8
00:00:13,462 --> 00:00:15,602
(Sheldon:)and went to Bed, Bath & Beyond.

9
00:00:19,134 --> 00:00:22,134
Excuse me! I'm on the phone!

10
00:00:23,639 --> 00:00:25,139
(Sheldon:)So rude.

11
00:00:27,710 --> 00:00:31,210
(Amy:)Here's another one.
Penny, if it weren't for Sheldon,

12
00:00:31,313 --> 00:00:35,733
(Amy:)you never would have met
comic book legend Stan Lee.

13
00:00:37,052 --> 00:00:38,392
(Penny:)Great.

14
00:00:41,323 --> 00:00:44,273
(Raj:)At least Leonard, Howard and I
would have always been friends.

15
00:00:44,827 --> 00:00:46,997
(Bernadette:)Hey, how come you three never
got an apartment together?

16
00:00:47,162 --> 00:00:49,272
(Leonard:)We talked about it,
but Howard was in

17
00:00:49,398 --> 00:00:52,008
(Leonard:)a pretty serious
relationship with his mom.

18
00:00:53,269 --> 00:00:55,149
(Howard:)I lived with her to save money.

